title: "BeeAdHoc"
abstract: >-
  BeeAdHoc, the honeybee-inspired routing protocol of Wedde & Farooq (2005),
  as a standalone swarm routing protocol for MANETs: scouts, foragers and an
  energy metric, as a planned simulator-agnostic C++ core and ns-3 contrib
  module on swarm-core.
